{"id": "EUVD-2026-89792", "enisaUuid": "7e9ad681-70fb-343a-bccd-2f555586a1c4", "description": "In the StAX streaming WS-SecurityPolicy validator, certain relative or unsupported XPath expressions can be converted into paths that never match the actual XML element path. A remote SOAP peer may therefore send a required element without the expected signature or encryption.\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to versions 4.0.2 or 3.0.6 or 2.4.4, which fix this issue.", "datePublished": "2026-09-30T11:57:01", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-30T19:47:41", "baseScore": 9.1, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:N", "references": ["https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/lwlozb1x20d16f9dnyvoygc9rrhzq2vn"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-87830", "GHSA-66vg-36xv-j6x4"], "assigner": "apache", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "75ae26dd-67ca-32e1-b2f5-f90a28c79a80", "product": {"name": "Apache WSS4J", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "4.0.0 <4.0.2"}, {"id": "7be4bebc-9cb8-3afb-ba35-1fbce0d623a6", "product": {"name": "Apache WSS4J", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "0 <2.4.4"}, {"id": "ce6826d9-f992-38e5-aaf8-7f44047d0168", "product": {"name": "Apache WSS4J", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "3.0.0 <3.0.6"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "1f848c8a-c6bc-3af1-8a18-6481a489020b", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}], "isExploited": false}